              "requirementId": "R1",
              "issue": "open() unwraps the outer VersionedCanonicalFlowRecords envelope, then unwrapInnerState() incorrectly requires another flowVersion field inside the inner CurrentFlowState. The required inner state contains structural schemaRevision and result version fields, but no inner flowVersion, so the mandated Version 2 fixture cannot be queried.",
