              "findingKey": "version-directory-identity-range",
              "title": "Version discovery rejects valid versions and accepts Version 000",
              "failureMode": "spec_behavior_contradiction",
              "file": "src/flow/query.js",
              "requirementId": "R1",
              "issue": "readVersionDirectoryEntries() only recognizes exactly three-digit directory names, while FlowVersion.pathSegment supports values greater than 999 and FLOW_QUERY_LIMITS allows up to 10,000 available versions. It also constructs CanonicalVersionDirectoryEntry(\"000\") as version 0 even though FlowVersion identities must be positive.",
